# VS Code REST Client examples. Never put API keys in this file.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@month = 2026-10

### Actual monthly summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ledgers/summary?month={{month}}

### Actual transactions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ledgers?month={{month}}

### Create an actual expense (writes to the active DB)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ledgers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-10-15",
  "amount": 12000,
  "category": "FOOD",
  "type": "EXPENSE",
  "expenseKind": "VARIABLE",
  "description": "점심"
}

### Recurring income settings
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/recurring-incomes

### Fixed expense settings
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/fixed-expenses

### Monthly forecast (synthetic DB, Python required)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/forecasts/monthly
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "month": "{{month}}",
  "historyStart": "2023-10-15",
  "historyComplete": true,
  "categories": ["FOOD", "SHOPPING"]
}

### Chat (synthetic DB, Python and paid OpenAI API required)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "이번 달 식비 예산 70만원으로 충분할까?",
  "history": [],
  "historyStart": "2023-10-15",
  "historyComplete": true
}
